flowchart LR
  R["https://host/scim/v2/{connectionId}/Users"]:::ext --> P["Resolve tenant and<br/>connection from the path"]:::walt
  P --> A{"Credential bound to<br/>this connection?"}
  A -->|"no, or unknown connection"| X["401<br/>(never reveals other tenants)"]:::bad
  A -->|yes| CTX["<b>ScimRequestContext</b><br/>tenant · connection · principal<br/>requestId · baseUri<br/>preconditions · compat profile"]:::lib
  CTX --> SPI["Every store call"]:::ext
  CTX --> EV["Every lifecycle event"]:::ext

